    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"shutting it down\" sounds so final. i've always been taught that when a system crashes you try to reboot or fix it, but i don't feel like i have the strength to reboot anymore. if i just... let the program close, would it actually be a relief? or is it just another way of failing?",
